%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: MinerIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Papers are in order. Gennady Kozlov. Coal Face B, east shaft. Twenty
      years underground.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I know I'm dirty. The showers at the shaft have been out for three
      days.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Do they fix things like that?
      npcResponse: Used to. Now they tell us to manage. We manage.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: That must be difficult work in this environment.
      npcResponse: Always been difficult. The conditions aren't worse. Just different.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my wife. Two sons on the top floor, east block. They
      work the west district now. The mine runs at capacity, or it doesn't run.
      Right now it runs.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Eleven hours today. I don't complain. Permit's here, March expiry.
      It's the right one.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What keeps you in the city?
      npcResponse: My wife. The job. What else would I do? I don't know anything
        except coal.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: Long shifts must take a toll.
      npcResponse: They do. But the alternative is standing still. That's harder.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
